{
  "_doc": "Tier-4 sawmill between the logging road and Larch Pond (region D6). A long mill on three levels: the basement (undermill, waste conveyor, line-shaft drives) with the payroll office and the fuse-room pocket at ground level; the saw floor (log deck along the pond side, carriage and headrig, live rolls, edger, trimmer end) and the locker room on level 1; the filing room, the manager's office and the lunchroom on level 2. Massing (ADR-0021): the saw floor rises two storeys, open to the roof timbers, with tall windows; the office block's filing room and lunchroom look down into it through their windows; one long gable runs over mill and offices, and the log deck is a lean-to on the pond side. Route: the big doors are barred from inside -> round to the log haul -> up the haul stairs onto the log deck (two walkers) -> loose deck boards into the saw floor wake its group -> stair hall -> filing room (office key, filer's notebook) -> Pruett's office (safe key) -> the lunchroom where the crew made its stand (ambush on the door) -> back down -> the dust chute by the headrig drops onto the waste conveyor (one way) -> the basement (held sleepers in the sawdust; loose boards or the office door wake them) -> the shipping room -> the payroll office behind a shotgun tripwire (loot; Gus guards it) -> out through the big doors, lifting the bar. A rotten patch in the saw floor by a tool chest drops greedy players into the basement. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
